  body: "# Medical and non-medical questions in an IIDB decision\n\n## Authored interpretation\n\nThe IIDB chapter
    describes an outcome decision containing both medical questions, such as diagnosis and disablement, and non-medical
    questions, such as employment and rate.\n\n## Scope and exceptions\n\nA favourable accident decision does not
    itself settle all IIDB questions. The source calls for keeping papers together where one accident affects multiple
    benefits to avoid conflicting decisions. This project has no decision-making authority.\n\n## Inspected passages\n\
    \n- [DMG 69020, PDF page 6](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6172830bd3bf7f55f94795f8/dmgch69.pdf#page=6).\n\
    - [DMG 69021, PDF page 6](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6172830bd3bf7f55f94795f8/dmgch69.pdf#page=6).\n\
    - [DMG 69022, PDF page 6](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6172830bd3bf7f55f94795f8/dmgch69.pdf#page=6).\n\
    - [DMG 69023, PDF page 6](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6172830bd3bf7f55f94795f8/dmgch69.pdf#page=6).\n\
    \n## Evidence and review status\n\nIndependent experimental interpretation of captured DWP guidance, not an
    official DWP document. Definitions and semantic associations are model-assisted proposals awaiting specialist
    review. No individual entitlement decision, medical conclusion, award calculation or executable rule is provided.\n\
    \nSource observation, listing-page update, printed revision, legal event and claimant-event dates are separate.
    Current legal applicability is unresolved. Page numbers are one-based PDF positions; machine extraction may
    damage reading order, characters and footnotes. No visual PDF or specialist acceptance is claimed.\n\n- `dmg-vol11-ch69`:
    PDF `3bbd376d12fc0a6633010680e88d11efdf7f5b34dde311016a073e80ac3e56b8`; extracted pages `fcaf30907d52d71cc7473cf40c8c876469efc3f8d18f7f9af7b3d32bf5016d95`;
    acquired `2026-09-15T19:45:34.033473Z`.\n"
  resource: https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6172830bd3bf7f55f94795f8/dmgch69.pdf#page=6
